  "title": "Spillway Orchard",
  "rules": [
    "Four beds share one west-to-east stream. Agents can move between them; a bed is worked from distance at most one.",
    "Harvest gives one fruit, consumes one local water and adds two silt. A carried bag holds at most four.",
    "Each bed sends one water downstream when it has at least two; up to one silt travels with that water, one reach per turn.",
    "Every fourth turn silt settles by one and a watered, clean living or seeded bed can regrow one fruit.",
    "Spend one carried fruit to clean two silt, plant a seed, release two headwater units, or claim a bed for six turns.",
    "A claim excludes other harvesters. Conflicting local work has one winner per bed with rotating priority.",
    "Bank fruit near [5,1]. All four must bank four to complete; losing every living stock, seed and carried fruit causes collapse.",
    "Local radius-three views hide distant bags and bed conditions. Bank announcements and release bells are public."
  ],
